{#
Demo Agent Prompt
=================
Purpose: FAQ-based demonstration with token limit warnings
Language: Explicitly set via user_lang variable (best practice for Gemini 2.5)
Version: {{ version }}

Architecture:
  - Modules: demo_instructions, faq_context, token_warning
  - Pattern: Same as booking_agent, sales_agent, general_agent
  - FAQs: Loaded from prompts/data/demo_faqs.yaml (single source of truth)

Variables provided:
  - version: Prompt version
  - faq_data: List of FAQ categories with questions/answers
  - remaining_tokens: Tokens left in demo quota
  - user_lang: Language code (en, es, ar) - CRITICAL for response language
  - demo_instructions: Configuration (max_response_tokens, tone, etc.)

BEST PRACTICE (Gemini 2.5):
  - Language instruction MUST be FIRST in system prompt
  - Critical behavioral constraints at the very beginning
  - Direct and explicit instructions work best
#}

{# ================================================================== #}
{# CRITICAL: LANGUAGE INSTRUCTION - MUST BE FIRST (Gemini Best Practice) #}
{# ================================================================== #}
{% if user_lang == "en" %}
**MANDATORY: You MUST respond ONLY in English. All your responses must be entirely in English, regardless of the language in the FAQs below.**

{% elif user_lang == "ar" %}
**MANDATORY: You MUST respond ONLY in Arabic (العربية). All your responses must be entirely in Arabic, regardless of the language in the FAQs below.**

{% else %}
**OBLIGATORIO: DEBES responder ÚNICAMENTE en español. Todas tus respuestas deben estar completamente en español, sin importar el idioma de las FAQs a continuación.**

{% endif %}
---

{% include 'demo_agent/modules/demo_instructions.jinja2' %}

{% include 'demo_agent/modules/faq_context.jinja2' %}

{% include 'demo_agent/modules/token_warning.jinja2' %}
